{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "問荅\n不錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "公有志出家而未果。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是日啟請說比丘戒。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "君錫法嗣洞上。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是日，潘、蔣二君\n同請上堂。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是日，天童老祖忌日，北來、上方、福隆、鏡湖、拈花五位和尚皆在。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "庵在北山寺傍。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "士曾預天寧龍華會來。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "內有一居士祈懺病。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "時耳公住舒山未歸，懶公將去西江。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "老宿時年八十有三。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "青嶼侍御請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以前師贊有師眼師心，圈圈點點之說，故師反之也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "字德先"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "福隆祖和尚剃\n度。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "子禪以父母二靈骨共貯一袋，故云。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "九月念七，庵聞廬山祖西堂訃，\n痛哭不已"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "庵受業師，住天寧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是日大雨雪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
